{"id":"c1feffdcdf98","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities","lang":"en","title":"Incoming administrative staff - mobility at USI","description":"Administrative staff members from other universities interested in undertaking a mobility period at USI are required to organize the details of their stay directly with the relevant contact persons in the host service or services.","section":"International Relations","crumbs":["International Relations","Specific information for:"],"image":null,"words":113,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/staff-in-entrata","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"International Relations","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"Incoming administrative staff - mobility at USI","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Administrative staff members from other universities interested in undertaking a mobility period at USI are required to organize the details of their stay directly with the relevant contact persons in the host service or services.<br> A description of USI’s administrative services and contact persons can be found <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/organisational-unit-type/3/servizi\">here</a>.</p> <p>The International Relations and Study Abroad Service is available only for supervising the application, signing official documents, and potentially granting <a href=\"https://movetia.ch/en/funding-opportunities/stays-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education/training-activities-abroad-for-staff-in-higher-education\">SEMP funding</a>. It is requested to fill in the form <a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint/relint-request_form_for_a_staff_mobility_at_usi.pdf\">Request form for a staff mobility at USI</a>.</p> <p>Please 